  "question": "Let \\(f(x)=ax^2+bx+c\\) for some real numbers \\(a,b,c\\). If \\(f(-5)\\ge10\\), \\(f(-3)<6\\) and \\(f(2)\\ge7\\), then which of the following cannot be true?",
